<title>HONG KONG: Liang Shing places shrs to Hongkong China.</title>
<headline>Liang Shing places shrs to Hongkong China.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sports shoe maker Liang Shing (Holdings) Ltd has agreed to place 56 million new shares, or 16.67 percent of expanded share capital, at HK$0.24 each to a third party which is a subsidiary of Hongkong China Ltd, Liang Shing said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Liang Shing shares fell HK$0.005 to HK$0.325 each in late morning with 776,000 shares changing hands.</p>
<p>Liang Shing said proceeds would be used for working capital. It said the share sale would strengthen its capital base and the purchaser intended to hold the shares as a long term investment. The placement is expected to be completed on October 25.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
